   "flags": {},
   "order": 11,
   "mode": 0,
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Decals, stickers and emblems with a see-through background\n**VTube Pro workflow, 8 GB graphics card** (SDXL). Pack 2026.10.01.\n\nGraffiti, stickers, patches and your own emblems for walls and costumes.\n\n## How to use it\n1. Describe the sticker in \"Your prompt\" (keep \"plain white background\").\n2. Press Run. The background is removed for you.\n3. Find the result in ComfyUI's **output/VTubePro** folder (or right-click the picture > Save Image).\n\nThe **green boxes** are the ones to change.\n\n**You get:** 1024x1024 PNG with a transparent background.\n\n**In VTube Pro:** Use it as a decal in your room or a patch on a costume. Pack several into one 2048 sheet to save memory.\n\n**Settings:** 1024x1024, 28 steps, CFG 6, BiRefNet cut-out.\n\n## Models (all allow commercial use)\n- [sd_xl_base_1.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0) (6.9 GB) in `models/checkpoints`: CreativeML Open RAIL++-M\n- [birefnet.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet) (0.4 GB) in `models/background_removal`: MIT\n\nMissing a model? ComfyUI offers to download it when you open this workflow. Or ask your AI: \n*\"Set up the VTube Pro sticker workflow in ComfyUI\"*: the VTube Pro Helper downloads every file from its official page, checks it, and adds this workflow, after you say yes.\n\n## Tips\n- A plain background gives the cleanest cut-out.\n- Thick outlines read well from far away.\n- Make pictures when you are not live: picture AI slows face tracking."
   ],
   "title": "Start here",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
